packages/shared-skills/upstreams/open-design/apps/landing-page/app/content/blog/byok-reality-check-5-things-that-break.md:2412:The framing matters, because the easy misread is "BYOK is half-baked." It isn't. None of the five below are "BYOK doesn't work" bugs. Every one of them lives at the boundary between an adapter we own — the OpenAI-compatible layer, the model picker, the finalize path — and one we don't: the upstream provider's CLI, their packaging choices, or the host platform's process model.
