packages/shared-skills/upstreams/open-design/apps/landing-page/app/content/blog/what-is-vibe-design.md:185:Vibe design is intent-first design: you describe, AI generates, you steer. Born from vibe coding and pushed mainstream by Google Stitch in 2026, it collapses the distance between idea and interface. But the version that matters doesn't stop at a mockup — **it's agentic, and it ships to code.** Start there and vibe design becomes real output, not just a nice picture.
